<section class="hero">
  <div class="inner">
    <div>
      <span class="badge info" style="text-transform:none;margin-bottom:14px">Dubai · Bali · Vietnam · Cambodia · UK · Europe</span>
      <h1>Your travel business, <em>powered by VaayuTrip</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lead">Airfares, hotels, activities, transfers, visas and travel insurance at agent net rates for Dubai, Bali, Vietnam, Cambodia, the UK and Europe. Build your own holiday packages from them, set your price, and send quotes and invoices with your own logo.</p>
      <div class="actions" style="margin-top:24px">
        <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href="/signup">Become a partner, free</a>
        <a class="btn btn-lg" href="/login">Log in</a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero-points">
        <li>No joining fee</li>
        <li>Approval in about one working day</li>
        <li>Your logo on every invoice</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="panel">
      <div class="card-head"><h3>Your package, your price</h3><span class="badge ok">Your logo</span></div>
      <table class="table">
        <tr><td>Delhi–Dubai return, 2 adults</td><td class="num">₹48,000 <small class="muted">net</small></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Dubai hotel, 4 nights</td><td class="num">₹24,800 <small class="muted">net</small></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Desert safari + Burj Khalifa, 2 adults</td><td class="num">₹14,600 <small class="muted">net</small></td></tr>
        <tr><td>Your markup (12%)</td><td class="num profit">+ ₹10,488</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Customer pays</b></td><td class="num"><b>₹97,888</b> <small class="muted">+ GST + TCS</small></td></tr>
      </table>
      <p class="muted" style="margin:12px 0 0;font-size:13px">Day-wise itinerary · Shareable link · Payment link · EMI</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="stats-strip" aria-label="VaayuTrip in numbers">
  <div class="inner">
    <div><b><%= stats.hotels %></b><span>hotels at net rates</span></div>
    <div><b><%= stats.activities %></b><span>tours &amp; activities</span></div>
    <div><b><%= stats.cities %></b><span>cities across 6 destinations</span></div>
    <div><b><%= stats.agents %></b><span>partner agencies selling today</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="features">
  <h2 class="big">Everything you need to sell travel</h2>
  <p class="center">One login for inventory, sales, money and marketing, built for small and growing agencies.</p>
  <div class="grid grid-3">
    <div class="feature"><div class="ico"><%- icon('plane') %></div><h3>Every building block at net</h3><p class="muted">Airfares, hotels, activities, transfers, visas and insurance for Dubai, Bali, Vietnam, Cambodia, the UK and Europe, contracted by the VaayuTrip team.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="ico"><%- icon('briefcase') %></div><h3>Build your own packages</h3><p class="muted">We don't sell packages; you do. Lay out the days, add our services to each one, and add anything you arrange yourself. Your package, your price.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="ico"><%- icon('receipt') %></div><h3>Branded invoices</h3><p class="muted">Bill customers under your own name and logo, or use a VaayuTrip invoice that already includes your commission.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="ico"><%- icon('globe') %></div><h3>Your own website</h3><p class="muted">A ready travel website with your branding and prices. Every enquiry lands in your leads.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="ico"><%- icon('wallet') %></div><h3>Wallet, credit &amp; payment links</h3><p class="muted">Book from your wallet or credit line. Collect from customers with payment links and EMI options.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><div class="ico"><%- icon('help') %></div><h3>Support and offers</h3><p class="muted">Raise a ticket from any booking and track the reply. Live deals and extra commission show up on your dashboard.</p></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="invoices" style="background:var(--bg);max-width:none">
  <div style="max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto" class="grid grid-2">
    <div>
      <h2 class="big" style="text-align:left">Two ways to bill your customer</h2>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:16px">You choose per quote.</p>
      <ol class="steps" style="margin-top:20px">
        <li><b>Your own invoice.</b> Your company name, logo, GSTIN and colours, with every item in your package, including your own hotels and services. VaayuTrip stays invisible to your customer.</li>
        <li><b>VaayuTrip invoice.</b> No logo yet? Send a VaayuTrip tax invoice that names you as the booking agent and already includes your commission, either built into the prices or shown as a service fee.</li>
        <li><b>B2B invoice.</b> Every booking also gets a VaayuTrip invoice to you at net rates, for your accounts.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h3>Popular activities</h3>
      <% activities.forEach(a => { %>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)">
          <img src="<%= cover({ image_url: a.image_url, destination: a.city }) %>" alt="" style="width:64px;height:48px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px">
          <div><b><%= a.title %></b><br><small><%= a.city %>, <%= a.country %> · <%= a.duration %></small></div>
        </div>
      <% }) %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="how">
  <h2 class="big">Start selling in a day</h2>
  <div class="grid grid-4" style="margin-top:28px">
    <div class="feature"><h3>1. Sign up</h3><p class="muted">Create your agency account.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><h3>2. Get verified</h3><p class="muted">We check your GSTIN or tax ID and approve you, usually within a working day.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><h3>3. Build your packages</h3><p class="muted">Pick our flights, hotels and activities for each day and set your price.</p></div>
    <div class="feature"><h3>4. Quote &amp; book</h3><p class="muted">Send branded quotes, collect payment, and book from your wallet.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align:center;margin-top:32px"><a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href="/signup">Create your free account</a></div>
</section>

<section class="section apply" id="apply">
  <div class="grid grid-2" style="align-items:start">
    <div>
      <h2 class="big" style="text-align:left">What you need to apply</h2>
      <p class="muted" style="font-size:16px">We verify every agency before it can book, to keep the network trusted and invoices compliant.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="ico"><%- icon('building') %></div>
        <h3>Agencies in India</h3>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>GSTIN of the agency</li>
          <li>GST registration certificate (PDF or photo)</li>
          <li>Work email and mobile number</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="feature">
        <div class="ico"><%- icon('globe') %></div>
        <h3>Agencies outside India</h3>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Company tax ID (VAT, TRN, EIN, ABN…)</li>
          <li>Tax or company registration certificate</li>
          <li>Work email and mobile number</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section faq" id="faq">
  <h2 class="big">Questions agents ask</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <details>
      <summary>Is there a joining fee or a minimum business commitment?</summary>
      <p>No. Joining is free and there are no monthly targets. You pay only for what you book, at net rates.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Does VaayuTrip give us ready-made packages?</summary>
      <p>No. We supply the building blocks separately at agent net rates: airfares, hotels, activities, transfers, visas and travel insurance. You design the packages yourself, day by day, so every holiday you sell is your own.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Which destinations do you cover?</summary>
      <p>Dubai, Bali, Vietnam, Cambodia, the United Kingdom and Europe (including France, Switzerland, Italy, the Netherlands and Spain). Our team keeps adding hotels, fares and activities in each.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How do I earn on each booking?</summary>
      <p>You add your markup to everything you book from us, as a percentage or a flat amount per booking, or price each line yourself, and charge your own price for anything you arrange yourself. Your Reports page tracks earnings month by month.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can my customer see VaayuTrip on the invoice?</summary>
      <p>Not if you don't want them to. Once you add your logo, quotes and invoices go out under your own brand. Without a logo, customers get a VaayuTrip invoice that names you as the agent and already includes your commission.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>How do I pay for bookings?</summary>
      <p>Top up your wallet by bank transfer or UPI and book instantly. Verified agencies can also get a credit line. Cancellation refunds go back to your wallet or credit.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>We're a travel agency outside India. Can we join?</summary>
      <p>Yes. Sign up with your company's tax ID and registration certificate instead of a GSTIN. Your tax ID appears on the invoices we issue to you.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What if something goes wrong on a trip?</summary>
      <p>Raise a ticket from Help &amp; support in your portal for a written record, or call or WhatsApp our team for anything urgent.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="inner">
    <div><h2>Ready to sell more trips under your own brand?</h2><p>Set up takes ten minutes. We'll verify you within a working day.</p></div>
    <a class="btn btn-accent btn-lg" href="/signup">Become a partner, free</a>
  </div>
</section>
